  "description": "Applies Majorsilence.Forms CSS themes to real System.Windows.Forms controls — one stylesheet restyles both halves of a mixed migration app. Walks the control tree and sets native properties (colors, fonts, FlatAppearance, DataGridView cell styles, a ToolStrip renderer, the Windows 11 title bar), keeps styling controls created later, and reports what WinForms cannot express as diagnostics instead of silently ignoring it.",
